installatore-apk (1.0.8-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Redraw the download indicator as a readable orange outline (tray plus
    downward arrow): the previous artwork filled the whole 40x29 canvas
    and rendered as a solid orange block.
  * Add translated package descriptions (it, en, de, fr, es, pt) so the
    software centre shows the text matching the system language, keeping
    the Italian title in every variant.
  * Install librsvg2-common (SVG loader) so the app icon and the download
    indicator actually render instead of showing an empty image.
  * Detect a failed texture load and fall back to a symbolic icon.
  * Use the requested orange download icon inside an orange rounded
    square for the installation progress indicator.
  * Add the installatore-apk CLI: without arguments it uses the single
    .apk file found in the current directory.
  * Show the app icon in the header bar and match the desktop entry to
    the com.simonecompany.installatoreapk application id so the system
    bar no longer shows a generic icon.
  * Show a green check with "Fatto!" when the installation completes.
  * Remove the project website link from the window and the README.

 -- Installatore Apk <installatore-apk@localhost>  Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
